===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Stunky|75}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*'''Spray Fluid''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Flashfire|Stunky|54}} from the {{TCG|Flashfire}} expansion.
